# No patch scripts

Do **not** create or use root-level `patch_*.py`, `fix_*.py`, or similar one-off editors.

## Instead

- Edit `app.py`, `pm_app/`, or `src/` directly
- Use git for history
- Legacy scripts are in `tools/archive/` (reference only, not runtime)

## Why

Patch scripts caused drift, duplicate logic, and made review/scaling impossible.
